e=\"background-color:rgb(0,255,255)\"><br></font></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">library(semPlot)</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">fit &lt;- lavaan:::cfa(mod2, data = light, <a href=\"http://std.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://std.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792431693441000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2bAHhPgoJg8zi-5jY_iOgI\">std.lv</a> = TRUE, fixed.x=FALSE)</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">semPaths(fit, title = FALSE, curvePivot = TRUE)</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><br></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"background-color:rgb(0,255,255)\"><b>However, </b></font><b style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">I have two inquiry </b></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"background-color:rgb(0,255,255)\"><b>1. is this the best way or there is another better way to draw? </b></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"background-color:rgb(0,255,255)\"><b>2. how to put the estimators values on the arrows in diagram?  </b></font></div></div></div>"
