    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>The help page tells you what labels are available, using the second argument &quot;what&quot;:<br><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><br><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">?semPlot::semPaths</span><br></div><br>For example, you can insert raw coefficients using<br><br><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><font face=\"courier new,monospace\">semPaths(fit, &quot;est&quot;, title = FALSE, curvePivot = TRUE)</font><br></div><br>or standardized coefficients using<br><br><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><font face=\"courier new,monospace\">semPaths(fit, &quot;std&quot;, title = FALSE, curvePivot = TRUE)</font><br></div><br>Terry<br></div></div>"
